</li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/mediterranean-and-middle-east-theatre-of-world-war-ii"><span class="ph ph-event" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Mediterranean and Middle East theatre of World War II</span><span class="tp">Ended · 1940–1945</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/second-sino-japanese-war"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/second-sino-japanese-war.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Second Sino-Japanese War</span><span class="tp">Ended · 1937–1945</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/second-united-front"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/second-united-front.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Second United Front</span><span class="tp">Ended · 1937–1945</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
